# Terraform local cache and downloaded providers
**/.terraform/**
terraform-provider-azurerm*.exe
terraform-provider-azurerm*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Local Terraform inputs can contain public IPs and key material
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json
!**/terraform.tfvars.example

# Private keys and local secrets
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519
.env
